{"id":"0006800fa1c85177","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-logic.md","title":"GL Logic","display":"df-gl-logic — GL Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-logic","aliases":["89-df-gl-logic"],"display":"df-gl-logic — GL Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-logic — GL Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{K}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{K}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : Gödel-Löb逻辑（可证性逻辑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K}\">\\(\\mathrm{K}\\)</span> : 基本模态逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a>)</li>\n<li>模式 4 在 GL 中可导出，不作为额外原始公理加入定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k","status":"resolved","id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-1","t